Old English ''[[sadolian]]''

====Verb====
{{en-verb|saddl|es}}

# To put a saddle on an animal.
# To get into a saddle.
# (''idiomatically'') To [[burden]] or [[encumber]].
# To give someone a responsibility or task, especially the one that is very unpleasant or tiring.

